        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Robert Plant, John Bonham, Phil Collins\n- Bands: Led Zeppelin\n- Events: Robert Plant's 1983 and 1985 tours\n- Roles: drummer, musician, songwriter\n\nFacts:\n- John Henry Bonham was born on 31 May 1948 and died on 25 September 1980.\n- John Bonham was an English musician and songwriter.\n- John Bonham was best known as the drummer for the British rock band Led Zeppelin.\n- Robert Plant avoided performing Led Zeppelin songs through much of that period.\n- Robert Plant's 1983 tour featured drummer Phil Collins.\n- Robert Plant's tours in 1983 and 1985 were very successful.\n- Robert Plant's 1983 and 1985 tours often played to sold-out arena-sized venues.",
